@startuml
title UC-09 TEL - native collection and stored query
actor Developer
boundary Console
control "Telemetry query service" as Query
control "Background collector" as Worker
database "Scoped telemetry repository" as Repo
control "Scoped credential resolver" as Credentials
participant "Kubernetes / EKS API" as K8s
Worker -> Repo: acquire source lease and fence
Worker -> Credentials: restore pinned workload target
Credentials --> Worker: private invocation credential
Worker -> K8s: read pods, timestamped logs, Metrics API
K8s --> Worker: bounded facts / safe partial failure
Worker -> Repo: commit facts and checkpoints under fence
note over Worker,Repo: Network calls occur outside transactions.\nHistory survives pod replacement; expiry is explicit.
Developer -> Console: open overview / logs / metrics
Console -> Query: scoped GET and interval/filter/cursor
Query -> Repo: authorize scope; read stored facts
Repo --> Query: history, aggregates, coverage
Query --> Console: safe DTO; null and stale remain explicit
Console --> Developer: summary; click through with same scope
@enduml
